Z||000027||Cooter||07-21-2000||12:26 AM||||It is an 88gt with a 3.4 and 4.10 four speed. The engine is stock, with 2inch duals, Indy roof scoop, MSD 6a and blaster coil. The big gauge is a monster tach with shift light. The factory tach did not work, so I replaced it with another and it was not accurate so I stuck TachZilla on the dash.<BR>I have not had time to do anything with the car in a couple of weeks because of some teacher workshops, but hopefully soon I will get a better video made and posted to DaRkLoRdS website.||||reg||1
